{
  "title": "Yellow Cornmeal Gooey Saudi-Arabian Cornmeal Pilaf",
  "description": "A traditional Saudi-Arabian dish featuring fine yellow cornmeal, cooked to perfection in a comal with a crispy and gooey texture.",
  "cuisine": "saudi-arabian",
